menu "MosuTime"

    config MOSU_SKIP_SD
        bool "Skip mounting the SD card (emulator / firmware tests)"
        default n
        help
            The ESP32-S3 emulator does not model an SD card, and its SDMMC
            controller keeps the CPU busy while it waits for one.  Enable this
            only for emulator builds: the watch then starts with the NVS
            configuration and stays silent.

endmenu
